{"seq":3,"slug":"use-effect-deep-dive","title":"useEffect 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/use-effect-deep-dive","wordCount":696,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"useeffect-深入\">useEffect 深入</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>useEffect</code> 的回调在 Commit 阶段之后异步执行，不阻塞浏览器绘制；<code>useLayoutEffect</code> 则在 DOM 变更后、绘制前同步执行。两者的差异决定了各自的适用场景。本章从执行时机入手，讲解 Cleanup 的调用时机、依赖数组的 <code>Object.is</code> 比较规则、异步 effect 中的竞态条件处理，以及何时应当改用 <code>useLayoutEffect</code> 以避免视觉闪烁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"useeffect-的执行时机\">useEffect 的执行时机</h2><p><code>useEffect</code> 的回调函数在 <strong>Commit 阶段之后异步执行</strong>，不会阻塞浏览器绘制。与之对比，<code>useLayoutEffect</code> 在 DOM 变更后、浏览器绘制前同步执行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Render 阶段] --&gt; B[Commit: Mutation]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Commit: Layout]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;useLayoutEffect 同步执行&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[浏览器绘制]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;useEffect 异步执行&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Render 阶段] --&gt; B[Commit: Mutation]\n    B --&gt; C[Commit: Layout]\n    C --&gt; D[\"useLayoutEffect 同步执行\"]\n    D --&gt; E[浏览器绘制]\n    E --&gt; F[\"useEffect 异步执行\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hook</th>\n<th>执行时机</th>\n<th>是否阻塞绘制</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>useEffect</code></td>\n<td>绘制后异步</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>数据获取、订阅、日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>useLayoutEffect</code></td>\n<td>绘制前同步</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>DOM 测量、布局调整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function Example() {&#10;  useLayoutEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const rect = divRef.current?.getBoundingClientRect();&#10;    setPosition({ x: rect?.left ?? 0, y: rect?.top ?? 0 });&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    fetchData().then(setData);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;div ref={divRef}&gt;content&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function Example() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useLayoutEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const rect = divRef.current?.getBoundingClientRect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setPosition({ x: rect?.left ?? 0, y: rect?.top ?? 0 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchData().then(setData);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div ref={divRef}>content&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cleanup-时机\">Cleanup 时机</h2><p>useEffect 的清理函数在<strong>下一次 effect 执行之前</strong>和<strong>组件卸载时</strong>调用。理解清理时机对于避免内存泄漏和状态错乱至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 组件&#10;    participant E as Effect&#10;&#10;    Note over C: Mount (deps=[A])&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;E: 执行 effect 回调&#10;    Note over C: Update (deps=[B])&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;E: 执行上一次的 cleanup&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;E: 执行新的 effect 回调&#10;    Note over C: Unmount&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;E: 执行最后一次的 cleanup\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 组件\n    participant E as Effect\n\n    Note over C: Mount (deps=[A])\n    C-&gt;&gt;E: 执行 effect 回调\n    Note over C: Update (deps=[B])\n    E-&gt;&gt;E: 执行上一次的 cleanup\n    C-&gt;&gt;E: 执行新的 effect 回调\n    Note over C: Unmount\n    E-&gt;&gt;E: 执行最后一次的 cleanup</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function ChatRoom({ roomId }: { roomId: string }) {&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const connection = createConnection(roomId);&#10;    connection.connect();&#10;&#10;    return () =&gt; {&#10;      connection.disconnect();&#10;    };&#10;  }, [roomId]);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;聊天室: {roomId}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function ChatRoom({ roomId }: { roomId: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const connection = createConnection(roomId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    connection.connect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      connection.disconnect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [roomId]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>聊天室: {roomId}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当 <code>roomId</code> 从 <code>&quot;general&quot;</code> 变为 <code>&quot;tech&quot;</code> 时：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>执行旧 effect 的 cleanup：<code>disconnect(&quot;general&quot;)</code></li>\n<li>执行新 effect：<code>connect(&quot;tech&quot;)</code></li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 每次 effect 执行都会&quot;捕获&quot;当时的 props 和 state（闭包）。cleanup 函数也捕获的是创建它时的值，而非最新值。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖数组比较\">依赖数组比较</h2><p>React 使用 <code>Object.is</code> 逐个比较依赖数组中的元素来决定是否重新执行 effect：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function areHookInputsEqual(nextDeps: readonly unknown[], prevDeps: readonly unknown[]): boolean {&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; prevDeps.length &amp;&amp; i &lt; nextDeps.length; i++) {&#10;    if (Object.is(nextDeps[i], prevDeps[i])) {&#10;      continue;&#10;    }&#10;    return false;&#10;  }&#10;  return true;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> areHookInputsEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nextDeps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prevDeps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prevDeps.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nextDeps.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Object.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">is</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nextDeps[i], prevDeps[i])) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>依赖类型</th>\n<th>比较结果</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原始值</td>\n<td>值比较</td>\n<td><code>Object.is(1, 1) → true</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象/数组</td>\n<td>引用比较</td>\n<td><code>Object.is({}, {}) → false</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>引用比较</td>\n<td>每次渲染创建的新函数 ≠ 旧函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"常见陷阱-对象依赖\">常见陷阱：对象依赖</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function UserPage({ userId }: { userId: string }) {&#10;  const options = { userId, includeDetails: true };&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    fetchUser(options).then(setUser);&#10;  }, [options]);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;{user?.name}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function UserPage({ userId }: { userId: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const options = { userId, includeDetails: true };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchUser(options).then(setUser);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [options]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>{user?.name}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>options</code> 每次渲染都是新对象，<code>Object.is</code> 返回 <code>false</code>，导致 effect 每次都执行。解决方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function UserPage({ userId }: { userId: string }) {&#10;  const options = useMemo(() =&gt; ({ userId, includeDetails: true }), [userId]);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    fetchUser(options).then(setUser);&#10;  }, [options]);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;{user?.name}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function UserPage({ userId }: { userId: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const options = useMemo(() => ({ userId, includeDetails: true }), [userId]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchUser(options).then(setUser);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [options]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>{user?.name}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>或者直接将原始值作为依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function UserPage({ userId }: { userId: string }) {&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    fetchUser({ userId, includeDetails: true }).then(setUser);&#10;  }, [userId]);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;{user?.name}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function UserPage({ userId }: { userId: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchUser({ userId, includeDetails: true }).then(setUser);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [userId]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>{user?.name}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"竞态条件\">竞态条件</h2><p>当 effect 中有异步操作时，组件可能在异步完成前就更新了依赖或卸载了。如果不处理竞态条件，旧的请求结果可能覆盖新的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function SearchResults({ query }: { query: string }) {&#10;  const [results, setResults] = useState&lt;string[]&gt;([]);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    let ignore = false;&#10;&#10;    searchApi(query).then((data) =&gt; {&#10;      if (!ignore) {&#10;        setResults(data);&#10;      }&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    return () =&gt; {&#10;      ignore = true;&#10;    };&#10;  }, [query]);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      {results.map((r) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;li key={r}&gt;{r}&lt;/li&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function SearchResults({ query }: { query: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [results, setResults] = useState&#x3C;string[]>([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let ignore = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    searchApi(query).then((data) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (!ignore) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setResults(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ignore = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [query]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {results.map((r) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;li key={r}>{r}&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;输入 &#39;ab&#39;&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;发起请求 #1: search(&#39;ab&#39;)&quot;]&#10;    A2[&quot;输入 &#39;abc&#39;&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;发起请求 #2: search(&#39;abc&#39;)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;请求 #2 先返回 → 设置结果&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E{&quot;ignore = true?&quot;}&#10;    E -- 是 --&gt; F[&quot;丢弃请求 #1 的结果&quot;]&#10;    E -- 否 --&gt; G[&quot;❌ 旧结果覆盖新结果&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"输入 'ab'\"] --&gt; B[\"发起请求 #1: search('ab')\"]\n    A2[\"输入 'abc'\"] --&gt; C[\"发起请求 #2: search('abc')\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"请求 #2 先返回 → 设置结果\"]\n    B --&gt; E{\"ignore = true?\"}\n    E -- 是 --&gt; F[\"丢弃请求 #1 的结果\"]\n    E -- 否 --&gt; G[\"❌ 旧结果覆盖新结果\"]</pre><p>使用 <code>AbortController</code> 可以更彻底地取消请求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;  const controller = new AbortController();&#10;&#10;  fetch(`/api/search?q=${query}`, { signal: controller.signal })&#10;    .then((res) =&gt; res.json())&#10;    .then((data) =&gt; setResults(data))&#10;    .catch((err) =&gt; {&#10;      if (err.name !== &#39;AbortError&#39;) {&#10;        setError(err);&#10;      }&#10;    });&#10;&#10;  return () =&gt; {&#10;    controller.abort();&#10;  };&#10;}, [query]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const controller = new AbortController();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fetch(`/api/search?q=${query}`, { signal: controller.signal })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .then((res) => res.json())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .then((data) => setResults(data))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .catch((err) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (err.name !== 'AbortError') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setError(err);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    controller.abort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, [query]);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"useeffect-vs-uselayouteffect\">useEffect vs useLayoutEffect</h2><p>两者 API 完全相同，区别仅在于执行时机。选择错误的时机会导致视觉闪烁或性能问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据获取</td>\n<td><code>useEffect</code></td>\n<td>不需要阻塞绘制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件监听 / 订阅</td>\n<td><code>useEffect</code></td>\n<td>不涉及 DOM 布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读取 DOM 布局</td>\n<td><code>useLayoutEffect</code></td>\n<td>需要在绘制前获取尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于布局的动画</td>\n<td><code>useLayoutEffect</code></td>\n<td>避免闪烁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tooltip 定位</td>\n<td><code>useLayoutEffect</code></td>\n<td>需要先测量再定位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function Tooltip({ anchorEl, children }: { anchorEl: HTMLElement | null; children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const tooltipRef = useRef&lt;HTMLDivElement&gt;(null);&#10;  const [position, setPosition] = useState({ top: 0, left: 0 });&#10;&#10;  useLayoutEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    if (!anchorEl || !tooltipRef.current) return;&#10;    const anchorRect = anchorEl.getBoundingClientRect();&#10;    const tooltipRect = tooltipRef.current.getBoundingClientRect();&#10;    setPosition({&#10;      top: anchorRect.bottom + 8,&#10;      left: anchorRect.left + (anchorRect.width - tooltipRect.width) / 2,&#10;    });&#10;  }, [anchorEl]);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div ref={tooltipRef} style={{ position: &#39;fixed&#39;, top: position.top, left: position.left }}&gt;&#10;      {children}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function Tooltip({ anchorEl, children }: { anchorEl: HTMLElement | null; children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const tooltipRef = useRef&#x3C;HTMLDivElement>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [position, setPosition] = useState({ top: 0, left: 0 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useLayoutEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (!anchorEl || !tooltipRef.current) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const anchorRect = anchorEl.getBoundingClientRect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const tooltipRect = tooltipRef.current.getBoundingClientRect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setPosition({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      top: anchorRect.bottom + 8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      left: anchorRect.left + (anchorRect.width - tooltipRect.width) / 2,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [anchorEl]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div ref={tooltipRef} style={{ position: 'fixed', top: position.top, left: position.left }}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {children}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>useEffect</code> 在浏览器绘制后异步执行，<code>useLayoutEffect</code> 在绘制前同步执行</li>\n<li>Cleanup 函数在下次 effect 执行前和组件卸载时调用，用于清理副作用</li>\n<li>依赖数组使用 <code>Object.is</code> 比较，对象和函数需要通过 <code>useMemo</code>/<code>useCallback</code> 保持引用稳定</li>\n<li>异步 effect 必须处理<strong>竞态条件</strong>，推荐使用 <code>ignore</code> 标志或 <code>AbortController</code></li>\n<li>DOM 测量和布局相关操作应使用 <code>useLayoutEffect</code> 避免视觉闪烁</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"useEffect 深入","id":"useeffect-深入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"useEffect 的执行时机","id":"useeffect-的执行时机"},{"level":2,"text":"Cleanup 时机","id":"cleanup-时机"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖数组比较","id":"依赖数组比较"},{"level":3,"text":"常见陷阱：对象依赖","id":"常见陷阱-对象依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"竞态条件","id":"竞态条件"},{"level":2,"text":"useEffect vs useLayoutEffect","id":"useeffect-vs-uselayouteffect"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自定义 Hook 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/custom-hooks-patterns"},"next":{"title":"useRef 与命令式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/use-ref-and-imperative"}}